---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { approvedPublicContactEmail } from '../config/public-contact.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice" description="Information about data processing on the Visha Shops pre-launch website.">
  <div class="content-container simple-page prose"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy first</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="intro">This notice describes the current static Visha Shops preview website. It will be reviewed and updated as the service evolves.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>The current site does not provide user accounts, checkout, newsletter subscription or a contact form. The in-page guide search runs locally in your browser and does not transmit search queries to a website backend.</p><h2>Hosting and technical logs</h2><p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process IP addresses, device details and technical logs to deliver pages and protect the service. Data handling and retention must be reviewed against the active hosting configuration.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>No third-party analytics, advertising tracking pixels or marketing cookies are integrated into this pre-launch source. We will update this notice before enabling optional analytics or other tracking.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to third-party websites may lead to their own privacy policies. Amazon referral links are not active in this pre-launch build.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy and editorial questions, email <a href={`mailto:${approvedPublicContactEmail}`}>{approvedPublicContactEmail}</a>. This notice must still be revised to reflect the actual hosting provider, retention and service configuration before additional services are enabled.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
